* DESCRIPTION:   Number of pancakes in TF coil
* JUSTIFICATION: Used in integer turn model

n_tf_wp_layers = 10
* DESCRIPTION:   Number of layers in TF coil
* JUSTIFICATION: Used in integer turn model

